                <div class="relative">
                  <img src="https://picsum.photos/seed/discover1/200/300" alt="小说封面" class="w-full h-48 object-cover rounded-lg">
                  <div class="absolute top-2 right-2 bg-primary text-white text-xs px-2 py-1 rounded">
                    玄幻
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div class="mt-2">
                  <h4 class="font-medium text-sm line-clamp-2">星辰大海：宇宙的终极奥秘</h4>
